        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d52668edc6a8d178a653254be800db37.avif?t=1785788419\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pungo</strong> is a fun PvP (player versus player) game, perfect for sharing and challenging friends. Inspired by the classic Pong, it adds a twist with adorable playable cats. Animated levels full of colors and different locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/f4e3927fa5e3a2fd5146eb7d4b8ab9cf.poster.avif?t=1785788419\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/f4e3927fa5e3a2fd5146eb7d4b8ab9cf.webm?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/f4e3927fa5e3a2fd5146eb7d4b8ab9cf.mp4?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and fantastic power-ups that boost your plays and activate your strategies during matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/ab6bb14f16b91c3949075223ff11978e.avif?t=1785788419\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and unlock all the cats in the Pungo collection! Each kitty has its own combination of abilities, unique stats, and different playstyles: try different combinations and find your best strategy to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d5461dd43461e51f16d82156fec6e0d0.poster.avif?t=1785788419\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d5461dd43461e51f16d82156fec6e0d0.webm?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d5461dd43461e51f16d82156fec6e0d0.mp4?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt, belly-bump, or kick, charge energy and unleash super strikes to dominate the court! Be the fastest kitty and enjoy every celebration!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes: choose between Best of 3 Goals or Match-Point to play your match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/583eece70c674ea25e88166fa14a7370.poster.avif?t=1785788419\" width=550 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/583eece70c674ea25e88166fa14a7370.webm?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/583eece70c674ea25e88166fa14a7370.mp4?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch mysterious boxes, unlock new characters, discover their stories, and complete your collection in the adorable universe of Pungo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Pungo and have fun with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/02023e2c23c0cd323c9d0e6d46de6b97.avif?t=1785788419\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now with Remote Play Together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The feline fun goes farther than ever!<br>Thanks to Steam’s <strong>Remote Play Together</strong> feature, you can now challenge your friends (or enemies!) even if they’re miles away. Only one player needs to own the game — just invite your buddies directly through Steam and play as if you were on the same couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pungo is all about sharing laughs, quick reflexes, and chaotic cat belly smashes — no matter where your rivals are!<br>Grab your controllers, connect those paws, and... let the ultimate cat duel begin!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d52668edc6a8d178a653254be800db37.avif?t=1785788419\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pungo</strong> is a fun PvP (player versus player) game, perfect for sharing and challenging friends. Inspired by the classic Pong, it adds a twist with adorable playable cats. Animated levels full of colors and different locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/f4e3927fa5e3a2fd5146eb7d4b8ab9cf.poster.avif?t=1785788419\" width=616 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/f4e3927fa5e3a2fd5146eb7d4b8ab9cf.webm?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/f4e3927fa5e3a2fd5146eb7d4b8ab9cf.mp4?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original and fantastic power-ups that boost your plays and activate your strategies during matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/ab6bb14f16b91c3949075223ff11978e.avif?t=1785788419\" width=780 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play and unlock all the cats in the Pungo collection! Each kitty has its own combination of abilities, unique stats, and different playstyles: try different combinations and find your best strategy to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d5461dd43461e51f16d82156fec6e0d0.poster.avif?t=1785788419\" width=550 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d5461dd43461e51f16d82156fec6e0d0.webm?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/d5461dd43461e51f16d82156fec6e0d0.mp4?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headbutt, belly-bump, or kick, charge energy and unleash super strikes to dominate the court! Be the fastest kitty and enjoy every celebration!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes: choose between Best of 3 Goals or Match-Point to play your match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/583eece70c674ea25e88166fa14a7370.poster.avif?t=1785788419\" width=550 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/583eece70c674ea25e88166fa14a7370.webm?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/583eece70c674ea25e88166fa14a7370.mp4?t=1785788419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scratch mysterious boxes, unlock new characters, discover their stories, and complete your collection in the adorable universe of Pungo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Pungo and have fun with friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603010/extras/02023e2c23c0cd323c9d0e6d46de6b97.avif?t=1785788419\" width=616 height=106 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now with Remote Play Together!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The feline fun goes farther than ever!<br>Thanks to Steam’s <strong>Remote Play Together</strong> feature, you can now challenge your friends (or enemies!) even if they’re miles away. Only one player needs to own the game — just invite your buddies directly through Steam and play as if you were on the same couch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pungo is all about sharing laughs, quick reflexes, and chaotic cat belly smashes — no matter where your rivals are!<br>Grab your controllers, connect those paws, and... let the ultimate cat duel begin!</p>",
        "short_description": "Two cats, a ball of yarn, and a duel full of reflexes and fun! Play solo or against a friend, use surprising power-ups, and unlock adorable kittens. With headbutts, belly bumps, and kicks on the court. Will you be the fastest cat? Show your skills in Pungo!",
